notes: "Cite arXiv:2604.22127v2. Version 2 corrects two evaluation-harness defects present in v1: GSM8K answers were extracted as the last '####' match from generations run without a stop sequence, and the HumanEval metric never executed. Most v1 conclusions are withdrawn. The corrected analysis is in reanalysis/. Single-seed (3407), two-model, sub-billion-parameter study."
